  "track.cleancode.m.map.s.lgtm.fix": "One thing per PR, a few hundred lines, reviewed against a checklist (chapter J10).",
  "track.cleancode.m.map.ctl.symptom.lgtm": "A 3,000-line PR approved in 2 minutes",
  "track.cleancode.m.map.s.fixLog.title": "Hunting a bug, the history says only \"fix\", \"fix 2\", \"wip\"",
