  "track.cleancode.m.map.ctl.symptom.fixLog": "Hunting a bug, the history says only \"fix\", \"fix 2\", \"wip\"",
  "track.cleancode.m.map.s.lateTry.title": "Promised \"I'll try\" for 6 days, done after 10.5, two bugs shipped",
  "track.cleancode.m.map.s.lateTry.detail": "Late by day 4: tests skipped, the weekend worked, nobody warned anyone.",
  "track.cleancode.m.map.s.lateTry.cause": "A hopeful number instead of an estimate",
